Simple English, everywhere. Use plain, everyday words and short sentences on every page — the homepage, FAQs, legal-page summaries, notifications, error messages, all of it. No jargon, no complex vocabulary, no long sentences where a short one says the same thing.
Logo size. Increase the logo in the header noticeably — it currently reads too small to register clearly at a glance. It should be one of the more prominent elements in the header, not a small icon beside the wordmark.
